  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">English Language Training for Officials - Strengthening Resilience: Intake 56</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to develop the English language capabilities of Officials from Mongolia, Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Viet Nam and Timor-Leste. It is themed around&#xA0;Strengthening Resilience&#xA0;and consists of preparation in-country, followed by&#xA0;a 13 week programme in&#xA0;New Zealand to cement language skills and relationships.</narrative>
  </description>
